  "ayudaDescripcion": "How to use LastBite and answers to the most common questions.",
  "ayudaAbrir": "Open help",
  "ayudaPrimerosPasos": "GETTING STARTED",
  "ayudaPaso1": "Add what you have at home: scan the barcode or type it in.",
  "ayudaPaso2": "Check your pantry: the products that expire first stay at the top.",
  "ayudaPaso3": "Cook with the suggested recipes and mark what you used as consumed to count food saved.",
  "ayudaPreguntas": "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS",
  "ayudaSeccionDespensa": "Pantry",
  "ayudaSeccionAgregar": "Adding products",
  "ayudaSeccionRecetas": "Recipes",
  "ayudaSeccionAlertas": "Alerts",
  "ayudaSeccionCompartir": "Shared pantry and shopping list",
  "ayudaSeccionCuenta": "Search, account and settings",
  "ayudaDespensaP1": "How do I mark a product as used?",
  "ayudaDespensaR1": "Tap it in the pantry and choose “Mark as consumed”. It counts toward your food saved and this month's savings. If you make a mistake, tap “Undo” in the message at the bottom.",
  "ayudaDespensaP2": "What do the days on each product mean?",
  "ayudaDespensaR2": "They are the days left before it expires. “Expiring soon” groups the ones that expire in 3 days or less; expired ones are marked in red.",
  "ayudaDespensaP3": "How are savings calculated?",
  "ayudaDespensaR3": "It's an estimate: what you consumed before it expired, multiplied by an average price for its category.",
  "ayudaAgregarP1": "What if the barcode isn't found?",
  "ayudaAgregarR1": "LastBite switches to manual entry. Type the name, choose the category and save.",
  "ayudaAgregarP2": "Who picks the expiration date?",
  "ayudaAgregarR2": "The app suggests one based on the product category. Change it before saving if the package says otherwise.",
  "ayudaRecetasP1": "What does each recipe's percentage mean?",
  "ayudaRecetasR1": "It's the share of ingredients you already have. Basics (salt, pepper, oil and water) count as available. In the details, each ingredient says “You have”, “Basic” or “Missing”.",
  "ayudaRecetasP2": "Why don't recipes change when my pantry changes?",
  "ayudaRecetasR2": "So you don't lose the one you were looking at. When your pantry changes, a notice appears with an “Update recipes” button.",
  "ayudaRecetasP3": "Why do they take a while to appear?",
  "ayudaRecetasR3": "An AI creates them from your pantry, which can take a few seconds. The first one shows up as soon as it's ready.",
  "ayudaRecetasP4": "What happens when I tap “I cooked it”?",
  "ayudaRecetasR4": "You choose which products ran out and they are marked as consumed. You can undo it from the message.",
  "ayudaAlertasP1": "When does an alert appear?",
  "ayudaAlertasR1": "When a product is about to expire or has expired. Alerts stay saved until you delete them.",
  "ayudaAlertasP2": "I'm not getting notifications",
  "ayudaAlertasR2": "Check that LastBite has notification permission in your phone settings.",
  "ayudaCompartirP1": "How do I share the pantry with my family?",
  "ayudaCompartirR1": "Tap “Shared” in the pantry and create a pantry. Give the code to whoever you want to add: they tap “Join with a code” and type it.",
  "ayudaCompartirP2": "Where is the shopping list?",
  "ayudaCompartirR2": "In “Shopping list”, at the top of the pantry. When you consume or delete a product, LastBite offers to add it.",
  "ayudaCuentaP1": "How do I search for a product?",
  "ayudaCuentaR1": "Tap “Search” in the pantry. You don't need the exact name: word order, accents and a typo don't matter.",
  "ayudaCuentaP2": "How do I change the text size, theme or language?",
  "ayudaCuentaR2": "In your account menu, “Accessibility”. You can also reset everything to the defaults there.",
